<mjml><mj-head><!-- VISIBILITY_STYLES --><mj-style>
      /* Desktop-first : les clients qui ne supportent pas @media
         (Outlook Web, Nouveau Outlook) gardent le comportement desktop. */
      .desktop-only, .desktop-only-outlook, [class*="desktop-only"] {
        display: block;
        width: auto;
        max-height: none;
        overflow: visible;
        line-height: inherit;
      }
      .mobile-only, .mobile-only-outlook, [class*="mobile-only"] {
        display: none;
        width: 0;
        max-height: 0;
        overflow: hidden;
        line-height: 0;
      }
      /* Mobile : afficher mobile-only, masquer desktop-only */
      @media only screen and (max-width:599px) {
        .desktop-only, .desktop-only-outlook, [class*="desktop-only"] {
          display: none !important;
          width: 0 !important;
          max-height: 0 !important;
          overflow: hidden !important;
          line-height: 0 !important;
          mso-hide: all !important;
        }
        .mobile-only, .mobile-only-outlook, [class*="mobile-only"] {
          display: block !important;
          width: auto !important;
          max-height: none !important;
          overflow: visible !important;
          line-height: inherit !important;
          mso-hide: none !important;
        }
      }
      /* Desktop explicit (pour spécificité) */
      @media only screen and (min-width:600px) {
        .desktop-only, .desktop-only-outlook, [class*="desktop-only"] {
          display: block !important;
          width: auto !important;
          max-height: none !important;
          overflow: visible !important;
          line-height: inherit !important;
          mso-hide: none !important;
        }
        .mobile-only, .mobile-only-outlook, [class*="mobile-only"] {
          display: none !important;
          width: 0 !important;
          max-height: 0 !important;
          overflow: hidden !important;
          line-height: 0 !important;
          mso-hide: all !important;
        }
      }
      /* Fallback : vrais appareils mobiles (Outlook mobile peut avoir un viewport &gt;600px) */
      @media only screen and (max-device-width:599px) {
        .mobile-only, .mobile-only-outlook, [class*="mobile-only"] {
          display: block !important;
          width: auto !important;
          max-height: none !important;
          overflow: visible !important;
          line-height: inherit !important;
          mso-hide: none !important;
        }
        .desktop-only, .desktop-only-outlook, [class*="desktop-only"] {
          display: none !important;
          width: 0 !important;
          max-height: 0 !important;
          overflow: hidden !important;
          line-height: 0 !important;
          mso-hide: all !important;
        }
      }
    </mj-style><!--[if mso | IE]>
      <style type="text/css">
        .desktop-only, .desktop-only-outlook, [class*="desktop-only"] {
          display: block !important;
          width: auto !important;
          max-height: none !important;
          overflow: visible !important;
          line-height: inherit !important;
          mso-hide: none !important;
        }
        .mobile-only, .mobile-only-outlook, [class*="mobile-only"] {
          display: none !important;
          width: 0 !important;
          max-height: 0 !important;
          overflow: hidden !important;
          line-height: 0 !important;
          mso-hide: all !important;
        }
        table.desktop-only, table.desktop-only-outlook, table[class*="desktop-only"],
        tr.desktop-only, tr.desktop-only-outlook, tr[class*="desktop-only"],
        td.desktop-only, td.desktop-only-outlook, td[class*="desktop-only"] {
          display: table !important;
          width: auto !important;
          max-height: none !important;
          overflow: visible !important;
          line-height: inherit !important;
          mso-hide: none !important;
        }
        table.mobile-only, table.mobile-only-outlook, table[class*="mobile-only"],
        tr.mobile-only, tr.mobile-only-outlook, tr[class*="mobile-only"],
        td.mobile-only, td.mobile-only-outlook, td[class*="mobile-only"] {
          display: none !important;
          width: 0 !important;
          max-height: 0 !important;
          overflow: hidden !important;
          line-height: 0 !important;
          mso-hide: all !important;
        }
      </style>
    <![endif]--><mj-attributes><mj-all padding="0">
            </mj-all></mj-attributes><mj-preview>Les dates de votre zone, et tout ce qu'il faut pour les enfants.</mj-preview></mj-head><mj-body background-color="#EFECE7" width="580px"><mj-section padding="24px 0 0 0"><mj-column><mj-spacer height="1px"></mj-spacer></mj-column></mj-section><mj-wrapper background-color="#FFFFFF" border-top="3px solid #6B4E3D" padding="40px 36px 44px 36px"><mj-section padding="0 0 28px 0"><mj-column><mj-text font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13px" line-height="20px" letter-spacing="4px" color="#222222" padding="0 0 6px 0"><p style="margin:0;text-transform:uppercase;">{{facility_name}}</p></mj-text><mj-text font-family="Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif" font-size="14px" line-height="22px" font-style="italic" color="#7A7672" padding="0 0 18px 0"><p style="margin:0;"><span style="font-style:normal;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B4E3D;">Vacances de printemps</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;[[Dates des vacances|Du 3 avril au 3 mai]]</p></mj-text><mj-divider border-width="1px" border-color="#E2DED7" padding="0"></mj-divider></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section padding="0 0 12px 0"><mj-column><mj-text font-family="Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif" font-size="17px" line-height="28px" color="#3A3A3A" padding="0"><p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Bonjour {{firstname}},</p><p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Les vacances de printemps arrivent, à des dates différentes selon votre zone. Chambres familiales, activités pour les enfants : tout est prêt, il ne manque que vous.</p></mj-text></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section background-color="#F8F6F2" border="1px solid #E2DED7" padding="18px 8px"><mj-column width="40%" vertical-align="middle" padding="0 10px"><mj-image src="https://api.trigger-flow.com/images/email-library/temps-forts/kids-600.jpg" href="{{booking_page_url}}" alt="Le printemps en famille" padding="0"></mj-image></mj-column><mj-column width="60%" vertical-align="middle" padding="4px 14px"><mj-text font-family="Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif" font-size="21px" line-height="27px" color="#222222" padding="10px 0 8px 0"><p style="margin:0;">Le printemps en famille</p></mj-text><mj-text font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14px" line-height="21px" color="#3A3A3A" padding="0 0 8px 0"><p style="margin:0;">Les dates de votre zone, et tout ce qu'il faut pour les enfants.</p></mj-text><mj-text font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12px" line-height="18px" color="#7A7672" padding="0 0 14px 0"><p style="margin:0;">Réservez en direct : [[Votre avantage|le lit d'appoint offert]].</p></mj-text><mj-button href="{{booking_page_url}}" align="left" background-color="#6B4E3D" color="#FFFFFF" border-radius="3px" font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14px" font-weight="bold" inner-padding="13px 24px" padding="0 0 8px 0">Voir les disponibilités</mj-button></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section padding="0 0 8px 0"><mj-column><mj-spacer height="20px"></mj-spacer></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section padding="0 0 26px 0"><mj-column><mj-text font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11px" letter-spacing="3px" color="#6B4E3D" padding="0 0 10px 0"><p style="margin:0;text-transform:uppercase;">Les dates de votre zone</p></mj-text><mj-text padding="0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border-top:1px solid #E2DED7;"><tr><td valign="top" style="padding:10px 14px 10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E2DED7;width:34%;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:16px;line-height:23px;color:#222222;">Zone A</td><td valign="top" style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E2DED7;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#3A3A3A;">Du [[Dates de la zone A|10 au 26 avril]]<br/><span style="font-size:12px;color:#7A7672;">Lyon, Bordeaux, Grenoble, Dijon…</span></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="padding:10px 14px 10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E2DED7;width:34%;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:16px;line-height:23px;color:#222222;">Zone B</td><td valign="top" style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E2DED7;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#3A3A3A;">Du [[Dates de la zone B|17 avril au 3 mai]]<br/><span style="font-size:12px;color:#7A7672;">Marseille, Lille, Nantes, Strasbourg…</span></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="padding:10px 14px 10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E2DED7;width:34%;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:16px;line-height:23px;color:#222222;">Zone C</td><td valign="top" style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E2DED7;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#3A3A3A;">Du [[Dates de la zone C|3 au 19 avril]]<br/><span style="font-size:12px;color:#7A7672;">Paris, Toulouse, Montpellier…</span></td></tr></table></mj-text></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section padding="0 0 26px 0"><mj-column><mj-text font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11px" letter-spacing="3px" color="#6B4E3D" padding="0 0 10px 0"><p style="margin:0;text-transform:uppercase;">Pour les enfants</p></mj-text><mj-text padding="0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;"><tr><td valign="top" style="padding:5px 10px 5px 0;width:12px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#6B4E3D;">&#8226;</td><td style="padding:5px 0;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#3A3A3A;">[[Activité|La piscine chauffée]]</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="padding:5px 10px 5px 0;width:12px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#6B4E3D;">&#8226;</td><td style="padding:5px 0;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#3A3A3A;">[[Activité|Le goûter offert chaque après-midi]]</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="padding:5px 10px 5px 0;width:12px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#6B4E3D;">&#8226;</td><td style="padding:5px 0;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#3A3A3A;">[[Activité|Le menu enfant au restaurant]]</td></tr></table></mj-text></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section padding="0 0 26px 0"><mj-column><mj-text font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11px" letter-spacing="3px" color="#6B4E3D" padding="0 0 10px 0"><p style="margin:0;text-transform:uppercase;">La chambre familiale</p></mj-text><mj-text padding="0"><div style="font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#3A3A3A;"><p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;"><strong style="color:#222222;">Tout le monde à son aise.</strong> [[Votre chambre familiale|Jusqu'à quatre personnes, deux espaces pour dormir, un lit bébé sur demande.]] Réservez en direct : [[Votre avantage|le lit d'appoint offert]].</p></div></mj-text></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section padding="10px 0 22px 0"><mj-group><mj-column width="24%" vertical-align="middle"><mj-image css-class="tf-locked" src="https://api.trigger-flow.com/images/email-library/temps-forts/portrait-320.jpg" alt="L'équipe de {{facility_name}}" width="68px" height="68px" border-radius="34px" align="left" padding="0"></mj-image></mj-column><mj-column width="76%" vertical-align="middle" padding="0 0 0 12px"><mj-text font-family="Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif" font-size="17px" line-height="26px" font-style="italic" color="#222222" padding="0"><p style="margin:0;">À très bientôt,<br/>[[Prénom du directeur|Claire]], et toute l'équipe de {{facility_name}}</p></mj-text></mj-column></mj-group></mj-section><mj-section padding="0"><mj-column><mj-divider border-width="1px" border-color="#E2DED7" padding="0 0 18px 0"></mj-divider><mj-text font-family="Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif" font-size="16px" line-height="26px" color="#3A3A3A" padding="0"><p style="margin:0;"><strong style="color:#222222;">P.S.</strong> Les chambres familiales partent en premier sur les deux semaines de votre zone : pensez à réserver tôt.<br/><a href="{{booking_page_url}}" style="font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;color:#6B4E3D;">Voir les disponibilités &#8250;</a></p></mj-text></mj-column></mj-section></mj-wrapper><mj-section padding="26px 24px 36px 24px"><mj-column><mj-social icon-size="20px" mode="horizontal" padding="0 0 12px 0"><mj-social-element name="instagram" href="{{social_instagram}}" src="https://app.trigger-flow.com/socialIcons/light/instagram.png" background-color="transparent" padding="0 7px"></mj-social-element><mj-social-element name="facebook" href="{{social_facebook}}" src="https://app.trigger-flow.com/socialIcons/light/facebook.png" background-color="transparent" padding="0 7px"></mj-social-element><mj-social-element name="tripadvisor" href="{{social_tripadvisor}}" src="https://app.trigger-flow.com/socialIcons/light/tripadvisor.png" background-color="transparent" padding="0 7px"></mj-social-element></mj-social><mj-text align="center" font-family="Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12px" line-height="19px" color="#7A7672" padding="0"><p style="margin:0;">{{facility_name}} · {{facility_address}}, {{facility_zip_code}} {{facility_city}}<br/>{{facility_phone}} · {{facility_email}}</p></mj-text></mj-column></mj-section></mj-body></mjml>